<p class="eyebrow">Galapagos history, knowledge and memory</p>
<h1>Galapagensis</h1>
<p class="lead">An independent research programme connecting the dispersed documentary history, memory and knowledge of the Galapagos Islands.</p>

<p class="development-notice">Galapagensis is taking shape. This website presents the programme’s research framework, available work and developing public architecture. Some sections illustrate planned forms of access; research and publications will be added progressively.</p>

